  "description": "Outline Groovy is a playful, retro-inspired display font designed to bring a fun 70s vibe to your creative projects. Featuring a bold, “bubbly” outline aesthetic, this font is perfect for DIY crafters using Cricut and Silhouette cutting machines. Its clean lines and nostalgic charm make it an ideal choice for t-shirt designs, personalized stickers, vinyl decals, groovy party decor, and social media graphics. Whether you’re working on a summer-themed craft or a vintage-style brand, Outline Groovy provides the versatile, high-energy look your customers love.\nOutline Groovy: A fun, retro 70s bubble font! Perfect for Cricut, stickers, and DIY crafts. Add a playful vintage touch to your designs today!",
